OL,3,GNEWSATenant called a tramp by housing
OL,4,Afirm worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA social housing tenant called a
OL,7,F"tramp" by a worker from his home's
OL,8,Fmanagement company, who used an
OL,9,Fexpletive with the slur, said it had
OL,10,Fleft him feeling worthless and "like
OL,11,Fscum".
OL,13,FThe customer, who the BBC has agreed
OL,14,Fnot to name to protect his daughter's
OL,15,Fidentity, said the insult had been the
OL,16,Ffinal straw after months of reporting
OL,17,Fmould in his home to the company.
