OL,3,GNEWSATenant called a tramp by housing
OL,4,Afirm worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeyond Housing runs 15,000 properties
OL,7,Facross the Tees Valley and North
OL,8,FYorkshire, some rented to people on low
OL,9,Fincomes or benefits. It said it had
OL,10,Fapologised profusely to the customer
OL,11,F"for the totally unacceptable
OL,12,Fbehaviour".
OL,14,FHenry - not his real name - said his
OL,15,Fliving situation had pushed him to
OL,16,F"breaking point".
